Value Filldown MODEL ([A-Za-z0-9_-]+)
Value Filldown VERSION ([^\r\n,]+)
Value UPTIME (.*?)
Value BOARD_NAME (.*?)
Value MAIN_PROCESSOR (\S+)
Value BOOTROM (\S+)
Value MEMORY (.*?)

Start
  ^ZXR10\s+${MODEL}\s*$$
  ^ZTE ZXR10 Software,\s+Version:\s+${VERSION}
  ^System uptime is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^Board Name\s+:\s+${BOARD_NAME}\s*$$
  ^Main Processor\s+:\s+${MAIN_PROCESSOR}\s*$$
  ^Bootrom Version\s+:\s+${BOOTROM}\s*$$
  ^System Memory\s+:\s+${MEMORY}\s*$$
  ^CPU Core Num -> Record End
